# src/packages/lumicore/src/security

## Purpose
Native security-analysis primitives.

## Contents
- Direct files (9): `anomaly.rs`, `blocklist.rs`, `challenge_solver.rs`, `credentials.rs`, `forensics.rs`, `gov_blocklist.rs`, `idn_sanitizer.rs`, `memory.rs`, `mod.rs`

## Interfaces and dependencies
- Rust module membership is controlled by `mod.rs`/`lib.rs`; Cargo is compile authority.
- Host-facing changes must preserve the versioned FFI envelope and private Go ABI declaration checks.

## Invariants
- Do not advertise or promote dormant native surfaces without the Cargo/ABI/CGO verification gate.

## Navigation
- Read this file first, then direct child `.context` files before editing a deeper folder.
